{
  "id": "E011",
  "title": "Giving Directions to the Driver",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-04-05",
  "synopsis": "If you plan on taking a taxi in China, it might be good to practice how to give directions. Here we see how you can tell the driver which way to go.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/102/c95afa922b6d19b59220fff8d7be75f345becf63.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "给司机指路\n\n王可： 师傅，我要去武东路。\n出租车司机： 武东路靠近什么路？\n王可： 武东路靠近国定路。\n出租车司机： 不好意思，那里我不太熟。到了那附近你可以给我指路吗？\n王可： 好的，没关系，我知道路。我给你指路。\n\n（十分钟后）\n\n王可： 现在左转……然后右转……一直走……停这里。\n出租车司机： 你是外国人，可是你比我熟。\n王可： 当然，我每天要来这里学习，唉。",
    "traditional": "給司機指路\n\n王可： 師傅，我要去武東路。\n出租車司機： 武東路靠近什麼路？\n王可： 武東路靠近國定路。\n出租車司機： 不好意思，那裡我不太熟。到了那附近你可以給我指路嗎？\n王可： 好的，沒關係，我知道路。我給你指路。\n\n（十分鐘後）\n\n王可： 現在左轉……然後右轉……一直走……停這裡。\n出租車司機： 你是外國人，可是你比我熟。\n王可： 當然，我每天要來這裡學習，唉。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Giving Directions to the Driver"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王可： 师傅，我要去武东路。",
      "traditional": "王可： 師傅，我要去武東路。",
      "pinyin": "wáng kě shī fu wǒ yào qù wǔ dōng lù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Ke: Driver, I want to go to Wudong Road."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "出租车司机： 武东路靠近什么路？",
      "traditional": "出租車司機： 武東路靠近什麼路？",
      "pinyin": "chū zū chē sī jī wǔ dōng lù kào jìn shén me lù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Taxi driver: Wudong Road is near to which road?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "王可： 武东路靠近国定路。",
      "traditional": "王可： 武東路靠近國定路。",
      "pinyin": "wáng kě wǔ dōng lù kào jìn guó dìng lù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Ke: Wudong Road is near to Guoding Road."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "出租车司机： 不好意思，那里我不太熟。到了那附近你可以给我指路吗？",
      "traditional": "出租車司機： 不好意思，那裡我不太熟。到了那附近你可以給我指路嗎？",
      "pinyin": "chū zū chē sī jī bù hǎo yì si nà lǐ wǒ bú tài shóu dào le nà fù jìn nǐ kě yǐ gěi wǒ zhǐ lù ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Taxi driver: I'm sorry, I am not familiar with that area. Can you show me the way when we are nearby?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "王可： 好的，没关系，我知道路。我给你指路。",
      "traditional": "王可： 好的，沒關係，我知道路。我給你指路。",
      "pinyin": "wáng kě hǎo de méi guān xi wǒ zhī dào lù wǒ gěi nǐ zhǐ lù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Ke: Okay, no problem, I know the area. I'll give you directions."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "（十分钟后）",
      "traditional": "（十分鐘後）",
      "pinyin": "shí fēn zhōng hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(ten minutes later)"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "王可： 现在左转……然后右转……一直走……停这里。",
      "traditional": "王可： 現在左轉……然後右轉……一直走……停這裡。",
      "pinyin": "wáng kě xiàn zài zuǒ zhuǎn rán hòu yòu zhuǎn yì zhí zǒu tíng zhè lǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Ke: Now turn left ...... and then turn right ……keep going ...... stop here."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "出租车司机： 你是外国人，可是你比我熟。",
      "traditional": "出租車司機： 你是外國人，可是你比我熟。",
      "pinyin": "chū zū chē sī jī nǐ shì wài guó rén kě shì nǐ bǐ wǒ shóu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Taxi driver: You are a foreigner, but you are more familiar (with this area) than I am."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "王可： 当然，我每天要来这里学习，唉。",
      "traditional": "王可： 當然，我每天要來這裡學習，唉。",
      "pinyin": "wáng kě dāng rán wǒ měi tiān yào lái zhè lǐ xué xí ài",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
